\par\par \b \uc2 BOK Aide: Speculators Seem To Be Targeting KRW, TWD  \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2005\par 04:52\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 SEOUL (Dow Jones)--The Bank of Korea has detected traces of speculation in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but that doesn't mean it will enter into joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  efforts with other central banks, according to a senior Bank of Korea official Thursday.  \par \par \uc2 "Speculators seem to be aiming for the won and the Taiwan \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  today and yesterday," said Rhee Gwang-Ju, director general of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's international department, at a press luncheon.  \par \par \uc2 However, Rhee said there is "no joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 " with the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to counter the dollar's weakness, although Korea has a close relationship with the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't engaged in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since...(early) last year. So joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't possible," Rhee said. [ 10-03-05 0415GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Asked how the international community can coordinate to turn around the weak dollar, Rhee said the U.S. must decrease its spending while other countries should boost domestic consumption.  \par \par \uc2 On the Chinese yuan, he said the market consensus now seems to be that China won't adopt a flexible \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate in the next couple of years.  \par \par \uc2 Told that dealers believe the Bank of Korea is purchasing huge amounts of dollars Thursday, Rhee said, "I hope such rumors spread."  \par \par \uc2 -By In Kyung Kim, Dow Jones Newswires; 822-732-2165; in-kyung.kim@dowjones.com  \par \par \uc2 -Edited by Mary de Wet [ 10-03-05 0519GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020050310e13a0006s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
