\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  says did not  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  market in Feb.  \b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Februar 2005\par 11:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2005 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Feb 28 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) said on Monday it did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in February, confirming it has stayed out of the market for nearly a year since its aggressive dollar-buying campaign in the 15 months to March 2004.  \par \par \uc2 MOF data showed the ministry stayed away from the market from Jan 28. to Feb. 24, as expected.  \par \par \uc2 Most analysts say the MOF seems not to be overly concerned with \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels at the moment, and its return to the market would require sudden \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swings.  \par \par \uc2 The last time the MOF stepped into the market was on March 16 last year, when the dollar fell close to two yen on the day to around 108.60 yen .  \par \par \uc2 Japanese authorities sold a record 20 trillion yen ($190 billion) in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in calendar 2003 and another 15 trillion yen in the first three months of 2004, fearing the yen's excessive strength could hurt the economy.  \par \par \uc2 Compared with that period the dollar is trading at much lower levels, and was around 104.35 yen on Monday, but traders say authorities in Tokyo seem unconcerned because the yen has not strengthened against other major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . ($1=105.28 Yen).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020050228e12s007n7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
