\par\par \b \uc2 POLL-Yen set to rise beyond 100/dollar in 2005.   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Natsuko Waki   \par \uc2 511 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Dezember 2004\par 13:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Dec 8 (Reuters) - The yen is expected to rise beyond 100 per dollar in the coming year, but the move will be gradual due to jitters about yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and concerns about \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's slowing economy, a Reuters poll showed on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 Median forecasts in the monthly poll of 57 analysts put the yen at 102 per dollar in the next month and in three months.   \par \par \uc2 The yen, which stood at 103.80 per dollar on Wednesday, is expected to edge higher to 100 in six months and to 99.5 in the next 12 months.   \par \par \uc2 "The yen continues to benefit from three areas that are unlikely to give way over the next 12 months: a healthy current account surplus, foreign investment into Japanese equities, and a broad based dollar decline," said Michael Woolfolk at Bank of New York. The Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a five-year high around 101.83 per dollar last week as the greenback tumbled across the board on concerns about the huge U.S. current account deficit.   \par \par \uc2 But it has since come off the high as markets have grown cautious about possible yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Japanese authorities - jitters expected to curb further yen strength in the coming year.   \par \par \uc2 "Verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Japanese officials is, so far, successfully slowing down the downtrend of dollar/yen," said Niels Christensen of Societe Generale.   \par \par \uc2 "But the Finance Ministry might soon have to ask the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  to resume \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if it wants to avoid dollar/yen from moving decisively below the 100 mark."   \par \par \uc2 SLOWING ECONOMY   \par \par \uc2 Japan, which boasts a credible track record of massive yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has repeatedly warned it would take bold action if needed.   \par \par \uc2 It spent around $330 billion trying to fight the dollar's slide between January 2003 and March 2004 but in recent weeks there have been no signs of yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Earlier this year robust economic data raised expectations the recovering Japanese economy had grown resilient to a strong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . This led investors to doubt \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a scale similar to the one seen in 2003 and early 2004.   \par \par \uc2 However, signs are emerging a recovery in the world's second largest economy is faltering.   \par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, data showed it grew only 0.1 percent in the three months to September as private consumption slowed. The economy also shrank by 0.1 percent in April-June from the previous quarter.   \par \par \uc2 "Japan's economy is slowing cyclically," said Benedikt Germanier of UBS.   \par \par \uc2 "This makes it unlikely that Tokyo will allow the dollar to plunge against the yen in 2005 - especially as we expect the Bank of Japan to also keep its zero interest rate policy for another two years."   \par \par \uc2 Under its ultra-easy monetary policy, introduced in March 2001, the BOJ floods the money market to keep interest rates near zero.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has pledged to maintain its current "quantitative easing" framework until year-on-year changes in consumer inflation stabilise above zero.    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041208e0c8007nf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
